{"parentUuid":"d3e41478-e6fe-4ccf-aad9-0d61ff59b726","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"prompt_snapshot","systemPrompt":["Extract the callable HTTP operations from the service contract documents. Return one JSON object only:\n{\"operations\":[{\"name\":\"the exact operation or service name used by the contract\",\"method\":\"GET or POST or another exact method\",\"path\":\"the exact URL path, beginning with /\",\"summary\":\"one short description\",\"request_schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"fieldName\":{\"type\":\"string or integer or number or boolean or object or array\",\"description\":\"meaning\",\"properties\":{\"nestedField\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"nestedField\"]}},\"required\":[\"fieldName\"]},\"response_fields\":[\"the significant JSON response field paths\"]}]}\nThe request_schema describes the entire request body, including envelope objects, all documented request fields, names, types, required fields and allowed values. Preserve nesting exactly. When the documents fix a field to a single value for this caller (a use-case code, a channel, a language), give that value as a one-value enum. When documents disagree about an operation, use the newest dated source, including a date in its filename. Do not infer a field or operation from a test-customer answer alone. Include every operation in the contract, including read, preview and write operations. Do not include authentication, OAuth or token endpoints as the phone agent's bank tools. Return only information supported by the documents; no customer-specific values or example amounts.","WebSearch takes a `mode`. Use \"standard\" by default: it is the normal search, quick and cheap. Use \"extended\" only when a \"standard\" result comes back thin, off-target or possibly outdated, or from the start for hard-to-find or niche facts, very recent events, prices and availability, and multi-step research: it is thorough and fresh but several times the cost. When you plan several searches, send them in the same turn."],"reminderFold":false,"echoWireToolInputs":true,"contextRendering":"announced"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"7df85854-d048-4213-a983-281ef760ecd8","timestamp":"2026-10-11T19:42:15.227Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-py","cwd":"/Users/yasardelibas/Desktop/Freya/Freya-Hackathon/build-the-builder","sessionId":"5e03e8d7-751f-4526-9ca7-8d2afe7f78ca","version":"2.1.294","gitBranch":"fix-agent-logic"}
